        <semantic:textAnnotation id="_78e5b959-5255-45a2-860b-e0ace2cd4edd">
            <semantic:text>How Escalation Events let subprocesses raise issues without failure.
The difference between Error Events (stop flow) and Escalation Events (ask for help).
Why BPMN escalation keeps autonomy local (AI moderation) and response centralized (human review).</semantic:text>
        </semantic:textAnnotation>
